message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release."
title: "On the Use of Quantile Regression Forests for Sub-seasonal Rainfall Forecasting over India"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-09
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/singh-bohar/india-monsoon-qrf-calibration"
abstract: >-
  Research code for calibrating GEFSv12 sub-seasonal Indian summer monsoon
  rainfall forecasts with Quantile Regression Forests and comparing them with
  Extended Logistic Regression.
keywords:
  - sub-seasonal forecasting
  - Indian summer monsoon
  - precipitation
  - quantile regression forest
  - probabilistic calibration
